        "original_id": "6115f708-7a4f-5de8-afcb-30dcc8f033e4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Somerville, Limbo, Inside\n- Companies: Jumpship, Playdead\n- Topics: indie video games, puzzle-platform games, 2016 in video gaming\n\nFacts:\n- Limbo is a puzzle-platform video game developed by the independent studio Playdead.\n- Limbo was released in July 2010 on Xbox Live Arcade and was later ported to systems including PlayStation 3 and Microsoft Windows.\n- Inside is the spiritual successor to Playdead's 2010 game Limbo and features similar 2.5D gameplay.\n- In 2016, the video game industry saw releases of new intellectual properties including Overwatch, Quantum Break, Tom Clancy's The Division, and The Last Guardian.\n- In 2016, the video game industry also saw indie releases including Abzû, Hyper Light Drifter, Inside, No Man's Sky, Owlboy, Stardew Valley, and The Witness.\n- Somerville is an upcoming video game and the debut title by the indie studio Jumpship.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "8d83596b-fb4e-5067-bb2a-28eac9c963cf",
        "text": "Page: Somerville (video game). Sentence: Somerville is an upcoming video game and the debut title by the indie studio Jumpship.\nPage: Limbo (video game). Sentence: Limbo is a puzzle-platform video game developed by independent studio Playdead.\nPage: Limbo (video game). Sentence: The game was released in July 2010 on Xbox Live Arcade, and has since been ported to several other systems, including the PlayStation 3 and Microsoft Windows.\nPage: Inside (video game). Sentence: It is the spiritual successor to Playdead's 2010 game \"Limbo,\" and features similar 2.5D gameplay.\nPage: 2016 in video gaming. Sentence: In addition, it saw the release of new intellectual properties, including \"Overwatch\", \"Quantum Break\", \"Tom Clancy's The Division\" and \"The Last Guardian\", and indie titles such as \"Abzû\", \"Hyper Light Drifter\", \"Inside\", \"No Man's Sky\", \"Owlboy\", \"Stardew Valley\" and \"The Witness\".",
